# Stop Conditions — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

**Spec ID:** {{SPEC_ID}}

The off-switches. When any of these fire, RALPH halts the loop and surfaces to a human.

---

## Configuration

| Knob | Value | Source |
|---|---|---|
| `iteration_cap` | {{ITERATION_CAP}} | `forge-defaults.yaml` (override per project) |
| `cost_cap_usd` | {{COST_CAP_USD}} | `forge-defaults.yaml` (override per project) |
